    ,
      "why": "pipelined_m also delivers 1 result/cycle but registers every m stages, trading latency (ceil(N/m)+2) for fewer FFs and a shorter critical path (higher Fmax). Since the objective is min luts_plus_ffs and the batch deadline (0.44 us) is tight, the m knob lets the search find lower-FF / higher-Fmax points that pipelined cannot reach, directly improving the Pareto front on the area axis. Same accuracy-relevant ranges as pipelined so the two families are comparable on the accuracy axis."
    }
